        "text": {
            "description_html": "<P><b>Fusion 35-A7, Traditional Brass Floral Knob with Contoured Radius Rose</b></P>\r\n<p>The detailing of Fusion Hardware's Floral Knob and rose grants this knobset an old world feel that is as elegant as it is beautiful. The simple Contoured Radius Rose allows for the classic styling to really shine. Made out of solid brass, it is available in 6 finishes, so you will be sure to find just the right color for your home. It will fit 1-1/4\" to 2\" thick doors and can be adjusted for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Features</b> of the Fusion 35-A7 Floral Knob and Contoured Radius Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<LI>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</LI>\r\n<li>Concealed screw assembly for sleek appearance.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<P><B>Specifications</B> for Floral Door Knobset Fusion 35 A7:\r\n<UL>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<LI>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</LI>\r\n<LI>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</LI>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p><B>When Selecting a Function:</B><ul>\r\n<li>Single Dummy: Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li>Dummy Set: Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li>Passage (Hall or Closet): For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom): For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul></p>",
